    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a solid start for a rebuttal. Can you go deeper on the 'dependency' part? My student needs to really nail the argument that UBI ruins the incentive to work. How can they frame that so it sounds like an undeniable economic reality rather than just an opinion?",
